{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24583","headline":"三年除夜 · 白居易","name":"三年除夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晰晰燎火光，氲氲腊酒香。\n嗤嗤童稚戏，迢迢岁夜长。\n堂上书帐前，长幼合成行。\n以我年最长，次第来称觞。\n七十期渐近，万绿心已忘。\n不唯少欢乐，兼亦无悲伤。\n素屏应居士，青衣侍孟光。\n夫妻老相对，各坐一绳牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}